==Trivia==
* The Mirage Island is based on a real phenomenon, called a "{{w|mirage}}".
** The Mirage Island also has the same effect as a {{w|mirage}}, as it can only be seen from afar and fades as the person gets closer.
* The Mirage Island used to have its [[Soundtracks|soundtrack]] removed due to a bug, making it temporarily the only [[Locations|island]] in the game without a soundtrack. But as of February 28, 2024, it was fixed and re-added after a bug fix.
* [[Destructible Physics]] does not work in the Mirage Island.
* Rarely, when the island despawns, the chests may occasionally remain. However, trying to loot the chest won't do anything.
* While using [[The Sentinel]] or [[Miracle]], the Mirage Island does not affect the height level of the flying boat.
** Exceptions: if the player found the [[Treasure Island]], the [[Haunted Shipwreck]], the [[Prehistoric Island]] or the [[Frozen Dimension]]. 
* The 50% clearer vision buff from the [[Kitsune Mask]] does not apply to Mirage Island when you get near it. 

